WEBVTT - Windmill Toe Touch Guidance

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Stand with feet wider than shoulder-width and arms extended out to your sides.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Hinge forward at your hips and gently rotate your upper body toward the opposite foot.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Extend your opposite arm toward the ceiling and look gently upward.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Return smoothly to the center and alternate to the other side.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Rotate through your ribcage while keeping a gentle micro-bend in your knees.

